      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "WHAT'S THE POINT (4) won well two back before going 1200m to 1780m and missing out in a close finish as the race fave. Back to the mile trip now won't be a problem and Galati sticking with him is a bonus. Can get back to winning ways in this suitable event. LUCKY LANDING (1) registered a strong win at this track two runs ago. Decent effort last time out when fourth over 1780m at this track, beaten 1.5 lengths. Well placed and there is no reason he cannot make amends. WHY ME (2) was below his best last time, finishing ninth and beaten 34 lengths over 2070m at this track. Has his share of talent and can do a lot better. ROMMEL'S GODDESS (6) finished out of the money two starts back then was beaten 7 lengths when fifth over 1300m at this track four days ago after being in the firing line on the corner. Has her share of talent. Hard to beat in this suitable race. FORTUNE'S LUCK (5) is next best.",
